                            </span>

                        </div>


                        <div class="intro-highlight-item">

                            <i class="fa-solid fa-lightbulb"></i>

                            <strong>
                                Curious Thinking
                            </strong>

                            <span>
                                Encouraging questions, exploration
                                and independent thought.
                            </span>

                        </div>


                        <div class="intro-highlight-item">

                            <i class="fa-solid fa-people-group"></i>

                            <strong>
                                Collaboration
                            </strong>

                            <span>
                                Learning through discussion,
